System-wide Docker management, maintenance, and Docker Hub/registry interactions.

Show Docker disk usage
#docker system df

Remove all unused Docker resources
#docker system prune

Remove all unused Docker resources including images
#docker system prune -a

Display system wide Docker information
#docker system info

Stream real time Docker events
#docker system events

Show Docker daemon information
#docker info

Show Docker client and server versions
#docker version

Log in to Docker Hub
#docker login

Log out from Docker Hub
#docker logout

List all Docker contexts
#docker context ls

Switch to a different Docker context
#docker context use <context_name>

